    stage2_test_runner_build_untyped_db_param_unresolved_method_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 FIXED. Stage 2 test_runner_build (bootstrap-fable-15) failed: MIR lowering error 'unresolved method call: update_test_result route=runtime-fallback owner=' in lib.nogc_sync_mut.test_runner.rust_test_runner because update_rust_test_database took its db receiver UNTYPED; 546541ef122 pulled the module into the runner closure. Fix: delete the dead function (zero callers; typing it pulled a 17-module DB closure into the runner and tripped a codegen worker SIGABRT, filed separately). Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/stage2_test_runner_build_untyped_db_param_unresolved_method_2026-11-12.md."

